# life.6

echo x - life.6
cat > "life.6" << '//E*O*F life.6//'
.TH LIFE 6 "30 July 1985"
.UC
.SH NAME
life \- the simulated game of life
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/games/life
[ libraryobjectfile.l ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Life is played on an infinitely large board and features 
macro commands, multiple objects, object libraries, and
lots of fancy stuff.

See /usr/games/lib/life/life.doc for full description.
.SH FILES
.br
/usr/games/lib/life.doc	the document
.br
/usr/games/lib/life/*.l	library objects
.SH AUTHOR
David I. Bell
//E*O*F life.6//

